\
Setup:\

\fs36 1. Open the different category views to add items\
2. In order to add an item, at least one must have a quantity higher than 0.\
3. Add to Cart to add them to cart\
4. Press the Cart Icon in the top right to open the cart\
5. If the cart is empty, checkout is disabled\
6. If the cart has items, the user can:\
a. Remove items one at a time and the cart will refresh\
b. Checkout and be presented with a confirmation window\
7. If they check out, the order confirmed screen will appear and the cart will reset to empty.
